//   prediction to five decimals. And the prediction must use the DISCRETE Laplacian eigenvalue
//   (2/dx^2)(1-cos(k dx)), not k^2: 0.3% apart, which is larger than the agreement being claimed, so comparing
//   to the continuum formula would compare two different operators.
