// v3410 -- THE UNGATED 125 ARE NOT 125 UNGATED PHYSICS MODULES. NINE ARE.
//
// gateReach has reported "63.3% of physics modules reachable from a gate" for three versions, and was careful
// every time to call it A DENOMINATOR, NOT A VERDICT. Nobody looked inside it. This round did.
//
// *** 116 OF THE 125 ARE FLAT simulation/*.js FILES, AND NOT ONE IMPORTS ANY PHYSICS MODULE. *** AliveLayer,
// AmbientNPCs, AquariumDemo, AsteroidsDemo, BoidsDemo, BossPhaseManager -- scene and demo code that was never
