// REPRODUCIBLE ONE ARE DIFFERENT PROPERTIES wearing one English sentence, and writing the shared key would have
// asserted that the theorem protects the session. *** THAT IS THE MOST DANGEROUS KIND OF WRONG, BECAUSE IT WOULD
// HAVE PASSED. ***
