// v3908 -- THE GITHUB PANEL REACHES THE OPS PAGE, AND THE BROWSER CAUGHT MY WIRING DEAD ON THE FIRST TRY.
//
// The GitHub Manager lived only on the engine page: main.js mounts ui/githubPanel.js into the left-edge dock, so
