// gap. The container is hidden now. Driven in Chromium: 4180.6s -> hidden, height 0; 45s -> shown; no runs ->
// hidden. THE MIDDLE FIXTURE IS THE ONE THAT MATTERS -- a ceiling that hid the line always would look identical
// from outside and would have thrown away the measurement this readout exists for.
