// ai-bridge/asset_library is inside the tree and also in SKIP_DIRS, so the packer never copies it. Measured on
// the built zip: zero entries. A proxy for a rule is not the rule, and this one failed toward refusing correct
// paths -- the direction nobody notices, because the feature just seems not to work. wouldBePackaged() now READS
// SKIP_DIRS from packagerBridge (newly exported for it) and fails CLOSED when there is no packer to ask, since
