// v3956 -- TWO render-qa FAILURES THAT WERE THE HARNESS, NOT THE PAGES -- AND ONE FEATURE THAT NEVER RAN ONCE.
//
// *** THE ASSERT RAN AFTER `finally { await ctx.close() }`. *** v2866 added per-page asserts to settle claims a
