// BLANK". Both are in .gitignore, withheld from the public mirror ON PURPOSE, so `git ls-files` carries neither
// and NO CLONE OF THIS REPOSITORY HAS EVER CONTAINED THEM OR EVER COULD. verify.mjs had hard-required them
// since it was written and always passed, because it had only ever run on the rig, where they exist as
