// why, and stale the moment the lab grows. 8 was a number-of-the-day. It is now a NAMED BASELINE that ratchets
// BOTH ways: a new dead knob fails as UNEXPLAINED, and a named one that comes back to life fails as REVIVED,
// because a baseline entry whose reason has expired is a ratchet holding nothing. Four sabotage probes, each
