    // CONSTANT, not a measurement, and it was declared to cover FOUR animators.
    //
    // MEASURED CONSEQUENCE, in a real headless Chromium on the real index.html: with the flag enabled, 0.0% of
    // frames were skipped in EVERY scenario -- idle, demo stopped, camera moving -- across three runs each,
    // and a repeated control gave 0.0 points of spread, so the zero was real rather than sampling luck.
