// Round 266 — satellite fleet. Cities periodically launch satellites
// that drift overhead, off-screen, orbit, and reappear from the other
// side. Active types (laser/EMP/kinetic/nuke) fire on kaiju when they
// pass within range; passive sensors (detection/IR/UV/aiming/signal)
