// Round 323 — Counter-Strike-style competitive map generator.
// Paints a de_-style bombsite layout (T spawn, CT spawn, mid, A site, B site)
// using OllamaLevelGenerator's paint pipeline + adds CS-style cover blocks.
// Round 324 — also wires CSRoundManager (plant/defuse + scoring) and HUD.
