          hint.innerHTML = 'Point the engine at a folder <b>outside</b> the engine for models/assets. Anything here is served as <code>/GPU_Assets/*</code> and <b>overrides</b> the bundled defaults (drop a Pip-Boy <code>.glb</code> here and it joins the avatar pickers). It\u2019s saved in <code>~/.voxelbridge/config.json</code>, so it sticks across every new engine zip \u2014 set it once. (The <code>VOXEL_ASSETS_DIR</code> env var, if set, overrides this.)';
